.subckt if_chain INP INN G1A G1B G2A G2B G3A G3B NB VTN OUTP OUTN VDD VSS
XBIF NB pbv VDD VSS bias_if
XV1 INP INN G1A G1B NB pbv a1p a1n VDD VSS vga
XF1 a1p a1n VTN f1p f1n VDD VSS gmc_lpf1
XV2 f1p f1n G2A G2B NB pbv a2p a2n VDD VSS vga
XF2 a2p a2n VTN f2p f2n VDD VSS gmc_lpf2
XV3 f2p f2n G3A G3B NB pbv a3p a3n VDD VSS vga
XV4 a3p a3n NB pbv a4p a4n VDD VSS vga_fix
XV5 a4p a4n NB pbv OUTP OUTN VDD VSS vga_fix
.ends
